Package: relay
Version: @VERSION@-1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Jerome Jardinero <jajardinero@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/jajardinero/rust-rdp
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @SHLIBS@, libwayland-client0, libxkbcommon0, libvulkan1, libegl1, libgl1, hicolor-icon-theme
Recommends: libopenh264-8
Suggests: fuse3, gnome-keyring, mesa-vulkan-drivers, va-driver-all
Description: Native Wayland RDP client with GPU video decoding
 Relay connects to remote desktops over RDP, with saved hosts, credential
 profiles, clipboard sharing, and GPU-accelerated graphics. Hardware H.264
 decoding uses VA-API and Vulkan when supported. A Wayland session is required.
